},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599853356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100879#issuecomment-2599853356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100879","id":2599853356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a9p0s","user":{"login":"pcvonz","id":6378569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzg1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6378569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz","html_url":"https://github.com/pcvonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T19:41:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T19:41:58Z","body":"I don't think this is a wayland issue. I have a PR open that moves away from using the `keys_pressed` set to detect if a key is pressed [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131). I'm not sure what the proper solution is for this issue. Maybe deriving the the set of keys pressed from `physical_keys_pressed` instead of attempting to keep track of them?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599853356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603217343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100879#issuecomment-2603217343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100879","id":2603217343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bKfG_","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T20:55:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T20:55:32Z","body":"Hi @pcvonz, thanks for the report and for investigating! I did some further research and it looks like the issue actually does actually come from the Wayland backend. As you found out, the keycodes come \"composed\" with the various modifier keys, which should not happen (you can see that when using the X11 display driver). I just pushed a PR with a proposed fix over at #101848.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603217343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]